@startuml SEQ_07_Dispute_Flow
title Sequence 7 — Dispute Flow

skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFFCC
skinparam sequenceGroupBorderColor #888

actor       "Household"             as HH
actor       "Student"               as ST
actor       "Admin"                 as AD
participant "Mobile App (HH)"       as AppH
participant "Mobile App (Student)"  as AppS
participant "Admin Dashboard"       as AppA
participant "TaskAPI"               as API
participant "Task Model"            as TM
participant "Dispute Model"         as DM
participant "RefundService"         as RS
participant "Transaction Model"     as TX
participant "TransactionLedger"     as TL
participant "NotificationService"   as NS
database    "PostgreSQL"            as DB

== Household Raises Dispute ==

HH   -> AppH  : Tap "Raise Dispute"\nSelect reason + enter description
AppH -> API   : POST /tasks/{T}/dispute/\n{reason: "Job not done",\ndescription: "Student left early"}

API  -> TM    : task = get(id=T)\nassert task.status in\n  [AwaitingConfirmation, Completed]
TM   -> DB    : SELECT tasks_task WHERE id=T
DB  --> TM    : task row

API  -> TM    : task.status = Disputed
TM   -> DB    : UPDATE tasks_task SET status='Disputed'

API  -> DM    : Dispute.objects.create(\n  task=T,\n  raised_by=HH,\n  reason="Job not done",\n  description="…"\n)
DM   -> DB    : INSERT INTO tasks_dispute
DB  --> DM    : dispute saved (id=D)

API  -> NS    : send(\n  recipient=ST,\n  type=DISPUTE_RAISED,\n  title="A dispute has been raised",\n  message="Please respond within 24h"\n)
NS   -> DB    : INSERT notification

API  -> NS    : send(\n  recipient=AdminGroup,\n  type=NEW_DISPUTE,\n  title="Dispute needs review",\n  task_id=T\n)
NS   -> DB    : INSERT notification

API --> AppH  : 200 OK {dispute_id: D, status: Disputed}
AppH --> HH   : "Dispute submitted. Admin will review."

== Student Responds (within 24 hours) ==

AppS -> ST    : Push notification — "Respond to dispute"
ST   -> AppS  : Enter response text
AppS -> API   : POST /tasks/{T}/dispute/respond/\n{student_response: "I completed all tasks"}

API  -> DM    : dispute.student_response = "I completed all tasks"\ndispute.student_responded_at = now()
DM   -> DB    : UPDATE tasks_dispute

API  -> NS    : send(\n  recipient=AD_GROUP,\n  type=DISPUTE_RESPONSE,\n  title="Student has responded to dispute"\n)
NS   -> DB    : INSERT notification

API --> AppS  : 200 OK
AppS --> ST   : "Response submitted."

== Admin Reviews Evidence ==

AD   -> AppA  : Open dispute D
AppA -> API   : GET /admin/disputes/{D}/audit/
API  -> DB    : SELECT CheckIn WHERE task=T\n(map, timestamps, coordinates)
DB  --> API   : checkin records
API  -> DB    : SELECT Message WHERE task=T\n(chat history)
DB  --> API   : messages
API  -> DB    : SELECT AuditLog WHERE task=T
DB  --> API   : audit trail
API --> AppA  : {checkins, messages, audit_logs,\ndispute, student_response}
AppA --> AD   : Location map + chat history + timeline

== Admin Resolves Dispute ==

AD   -> AppA  : Select outcome:\n  full_refund | partial_refund | release\nEnter admin_notes\n(+ partial_amount if applicable)
AppA -> API   : POST /admin/disputes/{D}/resolve/\n{outcome: "partial_refund",\npartial_refund_amount: 400,\nadmin_notes: "Student arrived but left early"}

API  -> DM    : dispute.outcome = "partial_refund"\ndispute.partial_refund_amount = 400\ndispute.admin_notes = "…"\ndispute.resolved_by = AD\ndispute.resolved_at = now()
DM   -> DB    : UPDATE tasks_dispute

alt outcome == full_refund
  API -> RS   : refund(task=T, amount=full_amount,\ntype=REFUND)
  RS  -> TX   : transaction.status = Refunded
  TX  -> DB   : UPDATE payments_transaction
  RS  -> TL   : TransactionLedger.record(\n  type=REFUND, status=COMPLETED\n)
  TL  -> DB   : INSERT ledger row

else outcome == partial_refund
  API -> RS   : partial_refund(\n  task=T,\n  refund_amount=400,\n  release_amount=full-400\n)
  RS  -> TX   : transaction.status = PartialRefund
  TX  -> DB   : UPDATE payments_transaction
  RS  -> TL   : TransactionLedger.record(type=REFUND, amount=400)
  TL  -> DB   : INSERT ledger row (refund portion)
  RS  -> TL   : TransactionLedger.record(type=RELEASE, amount=full-400)
  TL  -> DB   : INSERT ledger row (release portion)

else outcome == release
  API -> RS   : release_to_student(task=T)
  RS  -> TX   : transaction.status = Released
  TX  -> DB   : UPDATE payments_transaction
  RS  -> TL   : TransactionLedger.record(type=RELEASE)
  TL  -> DB   : INSERT ledger row
end

API  -> TM    : task.status = Completed
TM   -> DB    : UPDATE tasks_task SET status='Completed'

API  -> NS    : send(recipient=HH, type=DISPUTE_RESOLVED,\ntitle="Dispute resolved", message=outcome)
API  -> NS    : send(recipient=ST, type=DISPUTE_RESOLVED,\ntitle="Dispute resolved", message=outcome)
NS   -> DB    : INSERT notifications (x2)

API --> AppA  : 200 OK {dispute_resolved: true, outcome}
AppA --> AD   : "Dispute resolved."

@enduml
